                                                                                                                                                                                            <li><code>::deep .mud-tabs-tabbar { background-color: transparent !important; }</code> to flush tabs
                                                                                                                                                                                                into a parent panel &mdash;
                                                                                                                                                                                                <code>Components/Shared/Generation/Fragments/DetailerForm.razor.css:18</code></li>
