                                                                                                                                                                                                    &mdash; <code>DetailerForm.razor.css:33</code></li>
                                                                                                                                                                                                    <li><code>.tabs-header-container ::deep .mud-tabs</code> with
                                                                                                                                                                                                        <code>background: rgba(0,0,0,0.15); border-radius: 4px 0 0 4px;</code> &mdash;
                                                                                                                                                                                                        <code>Components/Gallery/GallerySettings.razor.css:31</code></li>
                                                                                                                                                                                                        <li>Nested tabs use <code>ApplyEffectsToContainer="true"</code> while <code>TabbedPageShell</code>
