                                                                                                                                                                                                                        page</div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                        <MudText Typo="Typo.caption" Color="Color.Secondary" Class="d-block mb-2">page Razor</MudText>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                        <pre style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.78rem; line-height: 1.4;"><code>&lt;MudTabs Centered Rounded
